Subject: [PROPOSED P19 SR4] mfreadwrite: forward source reconnect events

The injected-source control queues buffering, connect, reconnect and a final
metadata sentinel. P18 forwards every event except the reconnect pair.
Use the existing OnEvent route, without creating retries or new event types.
Not in a candidate series; runtime and cross-route qualification pending.

--- a/dlls/mfreadwrite/reader.c
+++ b/dlls/mfreadwrite/reader.c
@@ -850,6 +850,8 @@
         case MEBufferingStopped:
         case MEConnectStart:
         case MEConnectEnd:
+        case MEReconnectStart:
+        case MEReconnectEnd:
         case MEExtendedType:
         case MESourceCharacteristicsChanged:
         case MESourceMetadataChanged:
